  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Youth in Politics - Fellowship visit 2.0</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">VU-YPC aims to draw learnings from the 2025 election in Norway, 1 year prior to DK&#xfffd;s and MA&apos;s.We&#xfffd;ll interview three categories of youth (18-30) (~50% female), to learn about their perception of the democratic process and of whether their role matters. The categories:(i)disinterested youth(&#xfffd;couch lovers&#xfffd;), (ii)civically active apolitical youth, and (iii)politically engaged youth from various parties.We&#xfffd;ll also explore the impact and limits of youth-targeted digital tools like ung.no, in light of growing withdrawal and skepticism towards traditional politics.Part of the discussions will be recorded and posted as Reels, and a DK-NO-MA comparative policy paper will be published and shared with prominent political leaders in Morocco</narrative>
  </description>
